ion whose inhabitants live as if slavery had never been abolished. Feeling a sense of duty to those behind the heavy gates, she stays to liberate the people and see them through their first harvest. With four of her father's colleagues and a lawyer, she faces the daunting task of resurrecting the place known as Manderlay.","tagline":"Liberation. Whether they want it or not."},{"language":"da-DA","title":"Manderlay","overview":"Gangsterdatteren Grace rejser med sin far og en lille gruppe gangstere gennem USA, da de i en afkrog af Alabama kommer forbi godset Manderlay. Selvom slaveriet for længst er ophævet, lever beboerne her i et brutalt system, der fastholder dem som herrer og slaver. Grace ser det som sin pligt at befri Manderlay. Ved hjælp af gangsternes rå våbenmagt går hun i gang med at overbevise de skeptiske beboere om demokratiets velsignelser..."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eMGvlRS5Zn4b022sWvOGXhGnJfl.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dbAAQhptC6FyxBJx91IQv9zRiki.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1951,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"da-DA","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eMGvlRS5Zn4b022sWvOGXhGnJfl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eMGvlRS5Zn4b022sWvOGXhGnJfl.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eMGvlRS5Zn4b022sWvOGXhGnJfl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eMGvlRS5Zn4b022sWvOGXhGnJfl.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fHsuuIc6mYLd7mY0W45qFBgKJiF.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fHsuuIc6mYLd7mY0W45qFBgKJiF.jpg","language":"it","width":657,"height":985}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url